# The scraped source pages ARE committed (~1.6 MB for 30 files). GSMArena
# blocks unfamiliar IPs, so without them a fresh clone has nothing to fall back
# to and cannot build a knowledge base at all. They are the offline source of
# truth -- see "When GSMArena says no".
